00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.320 line:100%
Hang in there.

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.640 line:100%
I know it hurts. Hang in there.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.360 line:100%
Come on. I'll untie you.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:17.840 line:100%
Does it hurt?

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.120 line:100%
Those traffickers should rot in hell!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.040 line:100%
They should rot!

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.760 line:100%
<i>They all deserve it! They all do!</i>

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.240 line:100%
<i>That kid.</i>

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:28.800 line:100%
Why did he go to your place after?

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.160 line:100%
Pony, he told me

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.200 line:100%
his parents always fought.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.240 line:100%
He didn't want to go home.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.840 line:100%
He asked me if I could take him in.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.640 line:100%
Come on. Have a bit more.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:10.320 line:100%
Thanks, Daddy Peng.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:20.800 line:100%
Pony.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.320 line:100%
Eat up. Here.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.240 line:100%
-Thanks, Daddy Peng.
-You're welcome.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:54.920 line:20%
<i>CHINESE HISTORY, GRADE 8 VOL.2</i>

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.720 line:100%
Daddy Peng.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.920 line:100%
I'm going back to school today.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.920 line:100%
Okay. Then after school, I'll pick you up.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:18.800 line:100%
No need.

00:04:18.879 --> 00:04:20.520 line:100%
I haven't been home for days.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.960 line:100%
My parents must be worried.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.560 line:100%
I won't come here anymore.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.360 line:100%
Daddy Peng, thanks for taking care of me.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.240 line:100%
Dad's here.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.360 line:100%
This is your home.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.480 line:100%
From now on,

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.960 line:100%
focus on your studies
and keep up with your homework.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:58.640 line:100%
As for school,
you don't need to go anymore.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.480 line:100%
This is your home.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.640 line:100%
I'll teach you at home.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.640 line:100%
Pony is too young. He doesn't understand.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.840 line:100%
He has no idea how I feel as his dad.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:14.520 line:100%
What I fear most is that
he'll run away again someday.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.400 line:100%
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.080 line:100%
What am I supposed to do?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.280 line:100%
That's why I need to keep more ponies.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:22.960 line:100%
So I can feel at ease.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:42.720 line:100%
Going to an internet cafe?

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.680 line:100%
I'll give you a ride.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.080 line:100%
No charge. Get in.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.640 line:100%
Thanks, sir.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.320 line:100%
Eat.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.280 line:100%
Do you want to stay over tonight?

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:05.680 line:100%
Huh?

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.920 line:100%
I run a Trojan Horse Hotel here.
It's upstairs.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.240 line:100%
I… I don't have money.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:13.240 line:100%
No need to pay. Free.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.360 line:100%
It's convenient
both upstairs and downstairs.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.600 line:100%
Everything's right here.
Do whatever you like.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:18.800 line:100%
Sounds good.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:20.000 line:100%
Sounds good.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.000 line:100%
-That's nice!
-Nice!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:22.920 line:100%
Eat.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.840 line:100%
One pony.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.280 line:100%
Two ponies.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.640 line:100%
Three ponies.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.880 line:100%
Four ponies.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.040 line:100%
I have four ponies.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.640 line:100%
I cook for them every day.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.280 line:100%
<i>I study with them</i>
<i>and teach them how to behave.</i>

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.440 line:100%
What about Han Zi'ang?

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.560 line:100%
What's wrong with him?

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.680 line:100%
This pony is too disobedient.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.520 line:100%
Too disobedient. Too disobedient!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.200 line:100%
Too disobedient.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.760 line:100%
You must be starving. Eat up.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.000 line:100%
Thanks, sir.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:10.680 line:100%
My mom already cooked.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:11.880 line:100%
She's waiting at home.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.080 line:100%
Help! Help!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.960 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.240 line:100%
You're back?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:00.920 line:100%
You're back.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.800 line:100%
Peng is weird. Why's he ignoring me?

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.200 line:100%
-Right.
-No idea.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.560 line:100%
"If life deceives you…"

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.440 line:100%
"If life deceives you…"

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:25.360 line:100%
"…don't be sad, don't be anxious."

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.320 line:100%
"…don't be sad, don't be anxious."

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:30.720 line:100%
"Believe it,

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.120 line:100%
-the happy days…"
-Daddy Peng,

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.000 line:100%
I need the bathroom.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:43.200 line:100%
Go ahead.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.480 line:100%
Come on. Let's continue.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.840 line:100%
"The heart always longs for the future."

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.400 line:100%
"The heart always longs for the future."

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:00.800 line:100%
"Now is often full of sorrow."

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.280 line:100%
Pony, where's the bathroom?

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.760 line:100%
Let go of me! You bad guy!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:25.040 line:100%
You bit me! How dare you bite me!

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.480 line:100%
That's for biting me! Try that again!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:29.480 line:100%
I swear I'll kill you.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.040 line:100%
You never listen. Serves you right.

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:38.920 line:100%
Dad…

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:40.920 line:100%
Dad…

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.400 line:100%
-Dad…
-Pony?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:59.160 line:100%
Pony? You're back!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.640 line:100%
Pony!

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:14.240 line:100%
I missed you!

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:18.000 line:100%
I missed you!

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:25.320 line:100%
My pony!

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.120 line:100%
Good work.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:38.920 line:100%
Leave the rest to us.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:02.800 line:100%
I've been looking for you everywhere.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.360 line:100%
How'd you end up here?

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.280 line:100%
Listen, you did a great job today.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.280 line:100%
Director Zou just called.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.280 line:100%
He said he'll be highlighting

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:15.480 line:100%
He Xiaohe at the case briefing.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:17.880 line:100%
He also granted our task force
three days off.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.040 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.080 line:100%
Something on your mind?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:31.200 line:100%
Peng Dachuang may be alive,

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:37.120 line:100%
but he never really
made it out of that fire.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:42.160 line:100%
He tried everything
to make it up to his son.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.840 line:100%
He's completely consumed by it.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.600 line:100%
I remember Captain Ran mentioned
a theory in his book.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.720 line:100%
It's called "the domino effect".

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:01.760 line:100%
In this case,
a lot of seemingly unrelated events

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:05.480 line:100%
are actually like dominoes
spaced far apart.

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:09.280 line:100%
Maybe the first domino to fall

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:11.280 line:100%
was Peng Dachuang's son.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.240 line:100%
Family is… a strange thing.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:23.520 line:20%
When everything's fine,
people start looking for trouble,

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.800 line:20%
like they have to break it somehow.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:31.480 line:100%
But if it's missing a piece,

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.520 line:100%
people try hard to fix it.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.480 line:100%
I never thought I'd become a cop.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.760 line:100%
But when Uncle Ran was gone,

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.840 line:100%
my family felt incomplete.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.120 line:100%
I wanted to fix it.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.560 line:100%
Among all these lit windows,

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.840 line:100%
if one belonged to Uncle Ran,

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.800 line:100%
that'd be nice.

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:33.920 line:100%
SONG QINGSONG, DUE TO COLLUSION
BETWEEN WU SHANLONG AND ZHAO HONGMEI

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.080 line:100%
WROTE A RANSOM LETTER IN XU MENG'S NAME

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.240 line:100%
FURTHER USING XU MENG'S DEATH

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:38.560 line:100%
AND THE LEAKED DONGSHAN MINE BID
TO FORCE SONG QINGSONG OUT OF WEIYANG

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.840 line:100%
<i>After the Mount Wu accident,</i>

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.480 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng, to pay</i>
<i>for her father's treatment,</i>

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:46.600 line:100%
<i>went to Yuanlongli and worked</i>
<i>at Pattia as a masseuse.</i>

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:50.160 line:100%
<i>That decision was like the first domino</i>

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.120 line:100%
<i>in a long chain to fall,</i>

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.400 line:100%
<i>setting off a chain reaction.</i>

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.680 line:100%
Had a nightmare?

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.080 line:100%
What time is it?

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.640 line:100%
-Is the report done yet?
-Almost done.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.560 line:100%
Perfect. Take a look
and give me your thoughts.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:36.480 line:100%
I'm not used to this. Print it out later.

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:42.960 line:100%
Sir, we've gone paperless
at the bureau now,

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.320 line:100%
and there's a new
office automation system too.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.000 line:100%
I got you an account set up.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.200 line:100%
The username is your full name in pinyin,

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.640 line:100%
-and the password is…
-What system or whatever,

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.280 line:100%
I don't get it.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:58.080 line:100%
Me and this computer
just don't get each other.

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:00.000 line:100%
Whoever wants it can use it.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.600 line:100%
THE JUNE 30TH CASE HAS MULTIPLE SUSPECTS
AND TANGLED LEADS…

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:20.160 line:100%
With Song Qingsong's jump,
the June 30th case has to be closed.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.760 line:100%
I never thought my first case

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.280 line:100%
would end like this with a full stop.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.440 line:100%
At best, it's just a pause.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.400 line:100%
As for Xu Meng, her body's still missing.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:39.160 line:100%
Maybe one day,
her remains will surface again.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.960 line:100%
When that happens,
don't you start crying again.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.360 line:100%
Sir,

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.560 line:100%
if it weren't for you
scolding me back then,

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.040 line:100%
I'd probably be a teacher now.

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:55.000 line:100%
Good that you know.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.440 line:100%
By the way, sir,

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.960 line:100%
I've already filed a request

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.440 line:100%
to transfer you
to the administrative department.

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:14.520 line:100%
It's a new department,

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:17.840 line:100%
not much workload, so you can spend
more time with Xiaohe.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:25.600 line:100%
Sounds good.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.800 line:100%
This little troublemaker
used to skip class every day.

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:36.400 line:100%
Winter break's coming.
Might as well help her with her studies.

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:39.720 line:100%
Sounds good.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.360 line:100%
Let's go. Let's grab some rice noodles.

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:47.800 line:100%
I haven't finished the report.
Why don't you rest a bit longer?

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.920 line:100%
You want me to keep
having nightmares, right?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.120 line:100%
-Let's go.
-Coming.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.880 line:100%
Let me remind you,

00:17:57.960 --> 00:18:00.160 line:100%
don't just focus on work.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.840 line:100%
You need to think
about your personal life too.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:05.240 line:100%
I'm not in a rush.

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:06.640 line:100%
You're not, but I am.

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:09.720 line:100%
You two, not one of you
gives me peace of mind.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:11.880 line:100%
How am I not giving you peace of mind?

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.320 line:100%
<i>Let me introduce myself</i>

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.200 line:20%
<i>They call me a beggar…</i>

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:25.480 line:20%
<i>A flood took both my parents</i>

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:29.320 line:100%
<i>Now I live all alone</i>

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:34.720 line:100%
<i>With a worn-out begging basket</i>

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:38.320 line:100%
<i>And a bamboo stick to fend off dogs</i>

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.880 line:100%
<i>I wander through streets and alleys</i>

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:46.680 line:100%
<i>Past butcher stalls</i>

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.480 line:100%
<i>And restaurants</i>

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:53.080 line:100%
<i>Pawnshops and bank counters</i>

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:57.360 line:100%
<i>Calling out to ladies and gentlemen</i>

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:00.040 line:100%
<i>Have pity on this poor beggar…</i>

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:04.360 line:100%
Young little girl, no spirit,

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.360 line:100%
can't even match an old man.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.720 line:100%
Don't lie there. Come eat
the celebratory noodles.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.680 line:100%
Just noodles for a celebration?

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.320 line:100%
Not even a bit of oil?

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.720 line:100%
So what?

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:22.520 line:100%
Back then, your Uncle Ran and I
celebrated with noodles too.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.120 line:100%
Hurry up. Come here.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:39.240 line:100%
What are you looking at?
Do I have oil on my face?

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:44.880 line:100%
Dad, have you seen Uncle Ran again lately?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.600 line:100%
What do you mean?

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.840 line:100%
You want me to do therapy again?

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:52.600 line:100%
Drop that idea.

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:53.600 line:100%
I'm telling you,

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:57.760 line:100%
right now, I'm positive and healthy,

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.360 line:100%
better than you young people.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.320 line:100%
Hurry up. The noodles are getting cold.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:02.360 line:100%
Come on.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.120 line:100%
Eat.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:20.520 line:100%
Everything in here belonged to Uncle Ran.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:24.560 line:100%
You weren't really yourself before,
but now that you're better,

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.800 line:100%
I can finally
give these things back to you.

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:32.240 line:100%
Here, Comrade He Yuanhang.

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:16.040 line:20%
RETURNED MAIL: NO SUCH PERSON AT ADDRESS

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.200 line:20%
When you retired two years ago,

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.920 line:100%
you sent out all these letters.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:24.040 line:100%
But they were all returned.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.320 line:100%
Later, I checked with the registry.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:32.600 line:100%
They said Uncle Ran's grandma
passed away in 1992.

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.760 line:100%
MAIL TO GRANDMA IN SHANDONG

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.800 line:100%
FROM WEIYANG, SICHUAN

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:52.720 line:100%
MAIL TO GRANDMA IN SHANDONG

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:53.920 line:100%
FROM WEIYANG, SICHUAN

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.120 line:100%
I didn't expect that all those years…

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.560 line:100%
MAIL TO GRANDMA

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:00.600 line:100%
…Uncle Ran had been writing letters
to his late grandma.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:06.800 line:100%
This guy

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:10.200 line:100%
carries too many people in his heart.

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:15.440 line:100%
The living and the gone.

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.560 line:100%
How come I have no memory of any of this?

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:34.600 line:100%
It was that day.

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:35.520 line:100%
JUNE 3RD, 2013

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:36.840 line:100%
You suddenly fainted.

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:39.120 line:100%
After you woke up,

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:41.800 line:100%
you kept saying Uncle Ran
had come back from Beijing.

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:44.040 line:100%
I was terrified.

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:46.280 line:100%
I was afraid these things
would trigger you again.

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:47.400 line:100%
CHINA POST, SIGNATURE HE YUANHANG

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:49.440 line:100%
So I hid them all.

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:16.400 line:100%
This, is there a way
to recover the data inside?

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:18.520 line:100%
What for?

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:21.760 line:100%
I want to see if there's anyone left

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:23.640 line:100%
in your Uncle Ran's hometown
we can contact,

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:28.240 line:100%
so we can send his belongings back.

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:31.520 line:100%
So he can finally rest where he belongs.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:38.160 line:100%
This thing is so old,
and it's been burned.

00:23:40.240 --> 00:23:42.960 line:100%
Unless… there's some tech genius.

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:58.080 line:100%
I made you the property manager
to work with me.

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.000 line:100%
And what did you do?

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:01.640 line:100%
You're in league with those holdouts.

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:03.880 line:100%
If I don't pull out the big guns,

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:05.520 line:100%
how are we tearing
this building down next month?

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:06.440 line:100%
No…

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:09.480 line:100%
-Officer He?
-Uncle He.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:17.520 line:100%
Qian Dajun, what are you up to this time?

00:24:18.400 --> 00:24:19.240 line:100%
Come on.

00:24:19.320 --> 00:24:23.560 line:100%
I'm wholeheartedly thinking
about the community.

00:24:24.720 --> 00:24:27.000 line:100%
What you're saying,
the ghosts here might buy that.

00:24:27.080 --> 00:24:28.040 line:100%
I don't.

00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:33.560 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:24:33.640 --> 00:24:35.840 line:100%
Flank him from your side!

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:38.040 line:100%
I'll ambush him! I see him.

00:24:38.560 --> 00:24:39.600 line:100%
Lure him over!

00:24:42.640 --> 00:24:46.000 line:100%
Uncle He, try another way to say hi.

00:24:46.080 --> 00:24:47.360 line:100%
You nearly scared me to death.

00:24:47.440 --> 00:24:50.400 line:100%
If you keep staying up,
you'll be the one dropping dead.

00:24:53.120 --> 00:24:54.400 line:100%
Take a look at this.

00:24:54.480 --> 00:24:57.840 line:100%
Is there a way to get
the contacts from this phone?

00:24:59.640 --> 00:25:02.880 line:100%
Uncle He, why did you bring
this burnt brick back to me again?

00:25:02.960 --> 00:25:04.840 line:100%
Didn't I already extract it for you
two years ago?

00:25:05.440 --> 00:25:06.880 line:100%
Two years ago?

00:25:07.880 --> 00:25:11.280 line:100%
Two years ago, I worked my tail off.

00:25:12.840 --> 00:25:14.560 line:100%
Why don't I remember any of it?

00:25:15.960 --> 00:25:17.720 line:100%
Forget it. Do it for me again.

00:25:17.800 --> 00:25:18.840 line:100%
No chance.

00:25:18.920 --> 00:25:22.680 line:100%
This thing, once the data was extracted,
the motherboard was fried.

00:25:24.800 --> 00:25:26.200 line:100%
Didn't I email it to you?

00:25:26.280 --> 00:25:29.240 line:100%
All the data is in the attachments.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.160 line:100%
I don't really get this.

00:25:31.240 --> 00:25:33.120 line:100%
So you emailed me.

00:25:33.200 --> 00:25:35.400 line:100%
Then, the stuff inside,
you didn't keep a copy?

00:25:36.560 --> 00:25:39.160 line:100%
When I work, I leave no evidence.

00:25:42.400 --> 00:25:45.240 line:100%
Uncle He, what email did you use then?

00:25:47.960 --> 00:25:49.280 line:100%
I think…

00:25:49.960 --> 00:25:53.880 line:100%
I think it had an eye icon.

00:25:53.960 --> 00:25:55.000 line:100%
An eye?

00:25:59.840 --> 00:26:00.840 line:20%
Is this it?

00:26:00.920 --> 00:26:02.920 line:100%
Yes! That's it.

00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:05.360 line:100%
The username is my phone number.

00:26:05.960 --> 00:26:07.440 line:100%
The password…

00:26:08.560 --> 00:26:09.600 line:100%
The password…

00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:12.200 line:100%
I forgot it.

00:26:12.960 --> 00:26:14.240 line:100%
No problem.

00:26:14.320 --> 00:26:16.720 line:100%
I've got this. Three seconds.

00:26:18.680 --> 00:26:21.280 line:100%
One. Two. Three.

00:26:22.520 --> 00:26:24.600 line:100%
Who cut my power?

00:26:24.680 --> 00:26:28.040 line:100%
Who else could it be?
That heartless creep.

00:26:28.120 --> 00:26:29.880 line:100%
Qian Dajun!

00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:31.600 line:100%
It must be you!

00:26:49.360 --> 00:26:50.240 line:100%
Slow down.

00:26:51.120 --> 00:26:52.240 line:100%
Easy.

00:27:03.000 --> 00:27:05.040 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH, YUANLONGLI JUNE 30TH CASE

00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:11.240 line:100%
CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION FILES

00:27:16.680 --> 00:27:17.840 line:100%
INTERVIEW RECORD

00:27:17.920 --> 00:27:20.440 line:20%
YUANLONGLI JUNE 30TH CASE, SUMMARY REPORT

00:27:25.080 --> 00:27:26.480 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:27:26.560 --> 00:27:28.040 line:100%
The names are reversed.

00:27:28.120 --> 00:27:29.640 line:100%
No need.

00:27:30.400 --> 00:27:33.080 line:100%
He, we need to stick to the facts.

00:27:33.160 --> 00:27:34.200 line:100%
I'm sticking to the facts.

00:27:35.560 --> 00:27:37.720 line:20%
REPORTERS: RAN FANGXU, HE YUANHANG

00:27:56.080 --> 00:27:57.760 line:20%
MENGMENG NO.23

00:28:39.720 --> 00:28:40.560 line:20%
MAIL LOGIN

00:28:40.640 --> 00:28:41.520 line:100%
INCORRECT USERNAME OR PASSWORD

00:28:57.280 --> 00:28:59.480 line:100%
So early, what are you busy with?

00:29:00.960 --> 00:29:02.200 line:100%
Why aren't you at work?

00:29:03.120 --> 00:29:05.920 line:100%
The task force has three days off.
Director Zou approved it.

00:29:07.880 --> 00:29:10.160 line:100%
What's the password for this email?

00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:12.880 line:100%
How did you forget again?

00:29:12.960 --> 00:29:15.360 line:100%
Your full name in pinyin,
plus your birthday.

00:29:17.920 --> 00:29:19.160 line:100%
You haven't used it in years.

00:29:19.240 --> 00:29:21.480 line:100%
Why get trendy now?

00:29:25.760 --> 00:29:26.800 line:100%
INCORRECT USERNAME OR PASSWORD

00:29:27.520 --> 00:29:28.840 line:100%
Still wrong.

00:29:29.800 --> 00:29:31.400 line:100%
Capitalize the first letter.

00:29:46.360 --> 00:29:48.040 line:100%
DU, PHONE RECOVERY

00:29:50.040 --> 00:29:52.800 line:20%
CONTACTS.TXT, TEXTS.TXT, CALL LOG.TXT

00:29:56.280 --> 00:29:57.760 line:20%
CONTACTS.TXT

00:29:57.840 --> 00:29:59.280 line:20%
CONTACT LIST

00:29:59.360 --> 00:30:01.360 line:100%
COUSIN

00:30:10.000 --> 00:30:13.480 line:100%
0535…

00:30:13.560 --> 00:30:15.320 line:100%
32.

00:30:23.520 --> 00:30:26.560 line:100%
<i>Hello. The number you dialed is invalid.</i>

00:30:26.640 --> 00:30:28.520 line:100%
<i>Please check and dial again.</i>

00:30:38.200 --> 00:30:39.400 line:100%
TEXTS

00:30:43.200 --> 00:30:44.280 line:100%
DIRECTOR ZOU: DON'T STAY UP

00:30:44.360 --> 00:30:45.440 line:100%
RAN: DON'T STAY UP TONIGHT

00:30:45.520 --> 00:30:46.560 line:100%
<i>Don't stay up tonight.</i>

00:30:47.160 --> 00:30:48.200 line:100%
<i>Go home and rest early.</i>

00:30:48.760 --> 00:30:50.880 line:100%
<i>I'm fine, senior. I'll leave after work.</i>

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:53.600 line:100%
<i>That's an order. Go home now.</i>

00:30:54.640 --> 00:30:55.480 line:100%
<i>Copy that.</i>

00:30:56.600 --> 00:30:59.640 line:100%
<i>Ran, I saw a sweater today.</i>
<i>It would look good on you.</i>

00:30:59.720 --> 00:31:00.560 line:100%
SENDER: QIAO

00:31:00.640 --> 00:31:02.360 line:100%
<i>Are you free this weekend?</i>

00:31:02.440 --> 00:31:05.000 line:100%
<i>Sorry, Qiao. I've got to work overtime</i>
<i>this weekend.</i>

00:31:05.520 --> 00:31:06.520 line:100%
<i>Maybe next week.</i>

00:31:07.120 --> 00:31:09.160 line:100%
<i>Let's find a day for dinner.</i>

00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:11.920 line:100%
<i>Okay. Don't overwork yourself.</i>

00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:13.400 line:100%
<i>Get some rest.</i>

00:31:13.480 --> 00:31:14.400 line:100%
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:31:22.400 --> 00:31:24.000 line:20%
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE TO HE YUANHANG

00:31:35.440 --> 00:31:38.080 line:100%
Dad, what's wrong?

00:31:40.120 --> 00:31:41.120 line:100%
Dad.

00:31:55.680 --> 00:31:59.040 line:100%
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE TO HE YUANHANG

00:31:59.120 --> 00:32:04.280 line:100%
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE WAS WRONG
ALL WRONG

00:32:08.560 --> 00:32:10.920 line:100%
This message, I never received it.

00:32:11.000 --> 00:32:13.320 line:100%
Ran never sent it to me.

00:32:14.680 --> 00:32:16.200 line:100%
The June 30th case?

00:32:16.800 --> 00:32:19.200 line:100%
Isn't that the Xu father-daughter case?

00:32:19.280 --> 00:32:21.080 line:100%
Wasn't it closed long ago?

00:32:21.800 --> 00:32:24.480 line:100%
Why would Uncle Ran write this?

00:32:25.680 --> 00:32:28.760 line:100%
He must have gone behind my back
to reinvestigate it

00:32:29.680 --> 00:32:31.520 line:100%
and found a major clue.

00:32:32.120 --> 00:32:33.080 line:100%
So major…

00:32:34.280 --> 00:32:36.840 line:100%
it could overturn
all previous conclusions.

00:32:40.600 --> 00:32:42.680 line:100%
Dad. Look.

00:32:43.680 --> 00:32:46.440 line:100%
That was the night
something happened to Uncle Ran.

00:32:46.520 --> 00:32:49.400 line:100%
But this message
was drafted that afternoon.

00:32:57.160 --> 00:32:59.120 line:100%
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE
SAVE AT 2003-01-31 13:09:37

00:33:01.720 --> 00:33:03.560 line:100%
What was he trying to tell me?

00:33:04.480 --> 00:33:06.280 line:100%
Why didn't he send it?

00:33:07.560 --> 00:33:10.120 line:100%
Ran must have left with deep regrets.

00:33:12.040 --> 00:33:14.080 line:100%
Why didn't I see this email sooner?

00:33:18.640 --> 00:33:20.720 line:100%
PHONE RECOVERY BY DU ON JUNE 3RD, 2013

00:33:26.040 --> 00:33:28.640 line:100%
Dad, I brought food back.

00:33:28.720 --> 00:33:29.840 line:100%
Eat it while it's hot.

00:33:36.320 --> 00:33:37.440 line:100%
Dad?

00:33:45.400 --> 00:33:46.600 line:100%
Dad?

00:33:47.800 --> 00:33:49.720 line:100%
Dad! What did you do? Dad!

00:33:50.320 --> 00:33:52.520 line:100%
Don't scare me! Wake up! Dad!

00:33:52.600 --> 00:33:55.600 line:100%
What did you do? Dad!

00:33:56.120 --> 00:33:58.320 line:100%
Don't scare me! Dad!

00:33:59.280 --> 00:34:00.120 line:20%
Dad!

00:34:00.200 --> 00:34:01.040 line:20%
JUNE 3RD, 2013

00:34:01.120 --> 00:34:01.960 line:20%
Dad!

00:34:03.240 --> 00:34:04.120 line:20%
Dad!

00:34:04.640 --> 00:34:05.880 line:100%
PHONE RECOVERY BY DU ON JUNE 3RD, 2013

00:34:05.960 --> 00:34:07.160 line:100%
I get it now.

00:34:08.200 --> 00:34:09.039 line:100%
That time you fainted,

00:34:09.120 --> 00:34:10.560 line:100%
it must've been
because you saw this message.

00:34:10.640 --> 00:34:12.920 line:100%
That's why you kept imagining
Uncle Ran had come back.

00:34:16.439 --> 00:34:19.680 line:100%
So, this is the root of your illness.

00:34:22.880 --> 00:34:25.600 line:100%
I saw this message two years ago?

00:34:26.880 --> 00:34:29.400 line:100%
Dad, think hard again.

00:34:30.160 --> 00:34:31.360 line:100%
After the case was closed,

00:34:31.439 --> 00:34:34.320 line:100%
did Uncle Ran ever mention
the June 30th case again?

00:34:40.439 --> 00:34:41.280 line:20%
Who is it?

00:34:42.760 --> 00:34:44.760 line:20%
Sir, why are you…

00:34:48.640 --> 00:34:49.720 line:100%
What are you doing here?

00:34:50.320 --> 00:34:52.479 line:100%
It's the weekend,
and it's the Winter Solstice.

00:34:52.560 --> 00:34:55.320 line:100%
I brought Qiao to help
warm up your new place.

00:34:56.080 --> 00:34:56.920 line:100%
Ran.

00:34:59.720 --> 00:35:01.560 line:100%
I… I didn't prepare anything.

00:35:01.640 --> 00:35:03.920 line:100%
We're all friends. No need for all that.

00:35:05.040 --> 00:35:06.200 line:100%
Let her in already.

00:35:07.960 --> 00:35:08.880 line:100%
Come in.

00:35:08.960 --> 00:35:10.800 line:100%
The floor is dirty.
No need to change shoes.

00:35:16.560 --> 00:35:19.480 line:100%
Nice place. The bureau treats you well.

00:35:20.080 --> 00:35:21.520 line:100%
Just a bit musty.

00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:23.280 line:100%
It needs more life.

00:35:23.360 --> 00:35:26.040 line:100%
Have people over more. It'll be fine.

00:35:26.120 --> 00:35:28.440 line:100%
I'll get some plants for Ran later on.

00:35:29.360 --> 00:35:30.600 line:100%
Sounds good.

00:35:35.920 --> 00:35:37.400 line:100%
Don't bother.

00:35:37.480 --> 00:35:40.040 line:100%
You rarely come by. Let's eat downstairs.

00:35:40.880 --> 00:35:42.400 line:100%
Why eat at a restaurant?

00:35:42.480 --> 00:35:44.600 line:100%
We're not just warming your home,
we're firing up your kitchen too.

00:35:44.680 --> 00:35:46.640 line:100%
Qiao said she'd cook for you.

00:35:46.720 --> 00:35:48.400 line:100%
How can you refuse?

00:36:05.240 --> 00:36:06.440 line:100%
How nice.

00:36:12.920 --> 00:36:15.640 line:100%
Oh no. I forgot to pick up Xiaohe.

00:36:16.520 --> 00:36:17.400 line:100%
You two eat first.

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:20.480 line:100%
Sir.

00:36:21.920 --> 00:36:23.240 line:100%
Today is Sunday.

00:36:25.160 --> 00:36:26.120 line:100%
Is it?

00:36:27.680 --> 00:36:29.320 line:100%
Then she definitely
didn't do her homework.

00:36:29.400 --> 00:36:31.680 line:100%
I need to keep an eye on her. You two eat.

00:36:32.840 --> 00:36:34.200 line:100%
Sir!

00:36:37.840 --> 00:36:39.240 line:100%
I'll… see him out.

00:36:41.240 --> 00:36:42.080 line:100%
Sir!

00:36:43.840 --> 00:36:45.800 line:100%
Stay and have a bite with us.

00:36:45.880 --> 00:36:46.800 line:100%
No.

00:36:46.880 --> 00:36:50.320 line:100%
She's already putting herself out there.
You should show some interest too.

00:36:50.400 --> 00:36:52.160 line:100%
Qiao is a good girl.

00:36:52.680 --> 00:36:54.080 line:100%
Don't let her slip away.

00:36:58.840 --> 00:36:59.680 line:100%
Sir,

00:37:00.560 --> 00:37:03.800 line:100%
how's work in the new department?

00:37:05.240 --> 00:37:07.560 line:100%
It's much easier than field duty.

00:37:08.240 --> 00:37:09.560 line:100%
I'm thinking of writing

00:37:10.080 --> 00:37:12.360 line:100%
something about the June 30th case
when I get the time.

00:37:12.440 --> 00:37:13.880 line:100%
A detailed one.

00:37:13.960 --> 00:37:16.400 line:100%
If similar cases come up,
it can be a reference.

00:37:18.400 --> 00:37:22.000 line:100%
Me? All I can do now
is stay in the archives.

00:37:22.840 --> 00:37:24.000 line:100%
I have no choice.

00:37:24.080 --> 00:37:26.920 line:100%
My memory keeps betraying me.

00:37:27.480 --> 00:37:32.840 line:100%
Sir, do you remember the blue heels
from the June 30th case?

00:37:32.920 --> 00:37:34.480 line:100%
Blue heels? What about them?

00:37:35.720 --> 00:37:37.720 line:100%
The bureau had a pipe burst the other day.

00:37:37.800 --> 00:37:40.920 line:100%
Water was everywhere.
We spent ages cleaning up.

00:37:41.000 --> 00:37:44.240 line:100%
But those blue heels just went missing.

00:37:47.360 --> 00:37:49.240 line:100%
Maybe they were cleared out as junk?

00:37:49.320 --> 00:37:50.640 line:100%
But the case is already closed.

00:37:51.240 --> 00:37:52.960 line:100%
Doesn't matter if they're missing.

00:37:54.840 --> 00:37:55.840 line:100%
Alright. That's far enough.

00:37:55.920 --> 00:37:57.880 line:100%
Qiao is still busy upstairs.

00:37:57.960 --> 00:38:00.040 line:100%
Go help her. I'm off.

00:38:02.960 --> 00:38:04.160 line:100%
Take care.

00:38:11.760 --> 00:38:12.840 line:20%
Blue heels.

00:38:13.880 --> 00:38:15.160 line:100%
Ran mentioned the blue heels.

00:38:15.240 --> 00:38:16.800 line:100%
What blue heels?

00:38:17.880 --> 00:38:20.400 line:100%
In the June 30th case evidence,
there was a pair of blue heels.

00:38:20.480 --> 00:38:22.760 line:100%
They were what Xu Meng was wearing
when she went missing.

00:38:23.760 --> 00:38:26.200 line:100%
Those blue heels
were one of the key pieces

00:38:26.280 --> 00:38:27.800 line:100%
of evidence against Wu Shanlong.

00:38:27.880 --> 00:38:32.200 line:100%
Ran mentioned before that
when a pipe burst at the bureau,

00:38:32.280 --> 00:38:35.080 line:100%
he noticed those blue heels were missing.

00:38:35.160 --> 00:38:38.280 line:100%
The shoes went missing.
That doesn't prove anything.

00:38:38.360 --> 00:38:39.720 line:100%
How does it not prove anything?

00:38:40.600 --> 00:38:41.840 line:100%
It means back then,

00:38:41.920 --> 00:38:44.000 line:100%
Ran was already reinvestigating this case.

00:38:44.080 --> 00:38:45.160 line:100%
Otherwise, how would he know

00:38:45.240 --> 00:38:47.120 line:100%
that the evidence box
was missing evidence?

00:38:49.000 --> 00:38:51.440 line:100%
You go to the archives right now

00:38:51.520 --> 00:38:53.640 line:100%
and check the June 30th case files.

00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:55.640 line:100%
See if Ran added any new evidence.

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:57.360 line:100%
Okay.

00:39:05.240 --> 00:39:06.360 line:100%
Dad,

00:39:06.960 --> 00:39:09.120 line:100%
do we really need to push
this case this far?

00:39:10.880 --> 00:39:13.240 line:100%
These were Uncle Ran's last words.

00:39:13.320 --> 00:39:14.960 line:100%
Do you think we shouldn't push this?

00:39:22.600 --> 00:39:25.120 line:100%
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE TO HE YUANHANG

00:39:25.200 --> 00:39:28.080 line:100%
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE WAS WRONG
ALL WRONG

00:39:52.360 --> 00:39:55.000 line:20%
WOODCUT KNIFE